# --- Generated LaTeX source -----------------------------------------------
# The .tex is emitted by build_ocean_formalism.py. The script is the source of
# truth; committing the generated file as well produces noisy diffs on every
# rebuild. Delete the next line if you would rather ship the .tex in the
# Zenodo archive alongside the PDF.
Ocean_Scalar_Tensor_Hydrodynamics_*.tex
Ocean_Appendix_A_*.tex

